# main-final — the integrated tree, measured against the untouched baseline

`main@a990ca5` (integrated code at `37746db`) vs `fpq-baseline` (main@7e3d2e6).
Same command, one at a time, under `/tmp/fpq-bench.lock`.

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=baseline fpq-baseline benchmarks.sh 100000 1000000 10000000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=main fpq-main benchmarks.sh 100000 1000000 10000000'

